<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Fairer than all the earthborn race,</l><l>Perfect in comeliness Thou art;</l><l>Replenished are Thy lips with grace,</l><l>And full of love Thy tender heart.</l><l>God ever-blest! we bow the knee,</l><l>And own all fulness dwells in Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
